    "Provider outputs do not disclose their internal reasoning. Image weighting, training coverage, numerical handling, prompt interpretation and evidence trust remain untested hypotheses, not established causes.",
    "The supplied simulator measurements already support a deterministic local predicate. Separating observation from verification avoids asking a learned model to re-judge an available numerical rule."
  ],
